    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38958" root="منح" body-key="m">
    
      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استمنحهُ</span></b>  <i>He asked, desired,</i> or <i>sought,
a loan,</i> or <i>gift,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْحَة</span>,) <i>of him;</i> i. e., <i>asked,
desired,</i> or <i>sought aid,</i> or <i>assistance, from him;</i>
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِسْتَرْفَدَهُ</span>; (S;) or <i>asked, &amp;c., a gift from
him.</i> (K.)

